{"id":"d_counseling_marciana_marinestudy_14","cat":"counsel","group":{"id":"char5176","label":"Marciana: Marine Study"},"label":"Advising Marciana: Marine Study: 14","stage":null,"prev":"d_counseling_marciana_marinestudy_13","next":"d_counseling_marciana_marinestudy_15","speakers":{"marciana_s":"Marciana"},"icons":{"marciana_s":"si_c322_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"d_counseling_marciana_marinestudy_14_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"marciana_s","key":"Locale_Counseling:d_counseling_marciana_marinestudy_14_1","text":"The warmth of the sun, the laughter of the students...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"JungleIsland_Out_d","bgArt":"jungleisland_out_d","image":null,"bgm":"event_bgm_wtu_seabreeze","movie":null,"shown":["marciana_s"],"affinity":"_0"},{"id":"d_counseling_marciana_marinestudy_14_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"marciana_s","key":"Locale_Counseling:d_counseling_marciana_marinestudy_14_2","text":"I feel like I'll think back on this moment quite a bit once I return to the Ark.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":"_0"},{"id":"d_counseling_marciana_marinestudy_14_3","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Counseling:d_counseling_marciana_marinestudy_14_3","text":"Because you're sad you didn't get to enjoy the water much?","jump":"d_counseling_marciana_marinestudy_14_5","exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":"_100"},{"id":"d_counseling_marciana_marinestudy_14_4","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Counseling:d_counseling_marciana_marinestudy_14_4","text":"Because you made a lot of memories with your students?","jump":"d_counseling_marciana_marinestudy_14_8","exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":"_120"},{"id":"d_counseling_marciana_marinestudy_14_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"marciana_s","key":"Locale_Counseling:d_counseling_marciana_marinestudy_14_5","text":"... Not exactly.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":"_0"},{"id":"d_counseling_marciana_marinestudy_14_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"marciana_s","key":"Locale_Counseling:d_counseling_marciana_marinestudy_14_6","text":"We can swim and play in the water back at the Ark, too.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":"_0"},{"id":"d_counseling_marciana_marinestudy_14_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"marciana_s","key":"Locale_Counseling:d_counseling_marciana_marinestudy_14_7","text":"But this was the first graduation trip for both me and my students. I'm sure I'll look back on it fondly, and often.","jump":"d_counseling_marciana_marinestudy_14_12","exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":"_0"},{"id":"d_counseling_marciana_marinestudy_14_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"marciana_s","key":"Locale_Counseling:d_counseling_marciana_marinestudy_14_8","text":"Indeed. While it wasn't all sunshine and rainbows,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":"_0"},{"id":"d_counseling_marciana_marinestudy_14_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"marciana_s","key":"Locale_Counseling:d_counseling_marciana_marinestudy_14_9","text":"going on a graduation trip with my students was a new experience for me.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":"_0"},{"id":"d_counseling_marciana_marinestudy_14_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"marciana_s","key":"Locale_Counseling:d_counseling_marciana_marinestudy_14_10","text":"I'm sure this moment will help get me through tough times in the future.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":"_0"},{"id":"d_counseling_marciana_marinestudy_14_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"marciana_s","key":"Locale_Counseling:d_counseling_marciana_marinestudy_14_11","text":"I only hope that it will be the same for my students.","jump":"d_counseling_marciana_marinestudy_14_12","exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":"_0"},{"id":"d_counseling_marciana_marinestudy_14_12","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Counseling:d_counseling_marciana_marinestudy_14_12","text":"Marciana and I both promise to never forget this moment.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"none","bgArt":"none","image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":"_0"}]}